RecordAdministrationOfAVaccineToSnsUserController..>VaccineMapper
RecordAdministrationOfAVaccineToSnsUserController..>VaccAdministrationDosageMapper
RecordAdministrationOfAVaccineToSnsUserController..>VaccinationRecordsMapper


WaitingRoomMapper..>SnsUserDTO
WaitingRoomMapper..>SnsUser
InfoAndHealthConditionsMapper..>InfoAndHealthConditionsDTO
InfoAndHealthConditionsMapper..>"Health Records"
VaccineMapper..>VaccineDTO
VaccineMapper..>Vaccine
VaccAdministrationDosageMapper..>VaccAdministrationDosageDTO
VaccAdministrationDosageMapper..>Vaccine
VaccinationRecordsMapper..>VaccRecordsDTO
VaccinationRecordsMapper..>"VaccinationRecords"


